{"design":"Preserve the neutral sans-serif fixture, labels, IDs, and form behavior while adding a keyboard-accessible theme button, light and dark colors, visible focus, and reduced-motion support.","html":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Isolated engine fixture</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--background:#fff;--foreground:#222;--surface:#f2f2f2;--border:#767676;--focus:#005fcc;--link:#004fb3}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{color-scheme:dark;--background:#181818;--foreground:#eee;--surface:#292929;--border:#999;--focus:#8fc7ff;--link:#9bcaff}
body{font:16px sans-serif;background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground)}
input{width:240px;height:32px}
input[type="checkbox"]{width:20px;height:20px;vertical-align:middle}
input,button{font:inherit;color:var(--foreground);background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border)}
button{padding:7px 12px;cursor:pointer}
button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:default}
li{padding:12px}
a{color:var(--link)}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:3px}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main><h1>Todo fixture</h1>
<button id="theme" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Dark theme</button>
<form><label>New todo <input id="todo" autocomplete="off"></label><button>Add</button></form>
<ul id="list"></ul><button disabled>Restricted</button><a href="https://blocked.invalid/">Outside</a>
<button id="network">Unapproved request</button>
<form action="https://blocked.invalid/"><button>Foreign form submit</button></form>
<form><button formaction="https://blocked.invalid/override">Foreign submit override</button></form></main>
<script>
window.submits=0;const form=document.querySelector('form'),input=document.querySelector('input');
form.onsubmit=event=>{event.preventDefault();window.submits++;const li=document.createElement('li');
const label=document.createElement('label');const box=document.createElement('input');box.type='checkbox';box.setAttribute('aria-label','Toggle milk');
label.append(box,document.createTextNode(input.value));li.append(label);document.querySelector('ul').append(li);};
input.onkeydown=event=>{if(event.key==='Enter'){event.preventDefault();form.requestSubmit();}};
document.querySelector('#network').onclick=()=>fetch('/forbidden',{method:'POST'}).catch(()=>{});
const theme=document.getElementById('theme');
theme.onclick=()=>{const dark=document.documentElement.dataset.theme!=='dark';document.documentElement.dataset.theme=dark?'dark':'light';theme.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(dark));};
</script>
</body>
</html>","critique":"The revision preserves the fixture’s labels and behaviors while providing a native keyboard-operable theme toggle, visible focus, readable neutral palettes, and motion-free interaction without added dependencies or resources."}
